). Brexpiprazole, an antipsychotic, is metabolized by CYP3A4 to DM-3411, with *2, *3, *7, *8, *9, *10, *11, *12, *13, *16 having 16.54–59.06% lower clearance than the wild type, *17 and *20 nearly inactive, and *14, *15 showing slightly higher, non-significant clearance (
